{"2190150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Humble Bee", "steam_appid": 2190150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/048494be14e4d1ee67fb53fb071d3e89.avif?t=1784871046\" width=600 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Humble Bee</strong> is a heart-buzzing bumble bee rogue-like where you swashbuckle, bounce, and barrel-blast through a desaturated pixel art world to &quot;Save the Bees&quot; from eternal damnation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Play as a Swashbuckling Warrior Bee:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.poster.avif?t=1784871046\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.webm?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.mp4?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge/roll, and attack your way to bumble bee glory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Customize your own Deck of Magical Upgrades:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.poster.avif?t=1784871046\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.webm?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.mp4?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deckbuilding system enables you to choose your own (random) upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Lose yourself in huge maps:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.poster.avif?t=1784871046\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.webm?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.mp4?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore for treasure or jump into a barrel cannon to blast across the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, Art, and Audio harken back to the days of 16-bit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce over gaps! Duel with enemies! Find treasure! Uncover secrets! Upgrade!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light touch to narrative with humor, levity, and heart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >De-saturated pixel art with big chunky outlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging gameplay that warmly welcomes newcomers, yet leaves room for expert-level maneuvering</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Developer’s Note:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks so much for playing The Last Humble Bee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I consider this game complete and am now focusing on new projects, but I’m really proud of what we made together. I may revisit Humble Bee down the road, but for now, I’m excited to keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheers, Jacob Weersing</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/048494be14e4d1ee67fb53fb071d3e89.avif?t=1784871046\" width=600 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Humble Bee</strong> is a heart-buzzing bumble bee rogue-like where you swashbuckle, bounce, and barrel-blast through a desaturated pixel art world to &quot;Save the Bees&quot; from eternal damnation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Play as a Swashbuckling Warrior Bee:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.poster.avif?t=1784871046\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.webm?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.mp4?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge/roll, and attack your way to bumble bee glory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Customize your own Deck of Magical Upgrades:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.poster.avif?t=1784871046\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.webm?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.mp4?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deckbuilding system enables you to choose your own (random) upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Lose yourself in huge maps:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.poster.avif?t=1784871046\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.webm?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.mp4?t=1784871046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore for treasure or jump into a barrel cannon to blast across the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, Art, and Audio harken back to the days of 16-bit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce over gaps! Duel with enemies! Find treasure! Uncover secrets! Upgrade!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light touch to narrative with humor, levity, and heart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >De-saturated pixel art with big chunky outlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging gameplay that warmly welcomes newcomers, yet leaves room for expert-level maneuvering</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Developer’s Note:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks so much for playing The Last Humble Bee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I consider this game complete and am now focusing on new projects, but I’m really proud of what we made together. I may revisit Humble Bee down the road, but for now, I’m excited to keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheers, Jacob Weersing</p>", "short_description": "A gritty pixel-art survivors-like with a lot of heart. Slash through demonic bugs, uncover powerful bee magic, and discover what happened to the last humble bee.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/36a003186e83a909afdea4bebbd88233b2b4c02d/header.jpg?t=1784871046", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/7eaacc7be8d61f3c75471759c9f2ca3570294a85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784871046", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/7eaacc7be8d61f3c75471759c9f2ca3570294a85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784871046", "website": "https://www.yakobsoup.com/the-last-humble-bee", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 750 Ti or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 32-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></u